sile to where you want to launch it and after that you ungrab it and now you're able to control it \n\n2. airstrike(new feature) \nSpawn or find missile you can use 1,2 or 3 the max is 5 after you find for example 5 missiles you grab them and click store and then you ungrab it and do the same to all of the other missiles and now you will have five missiles floating above your head and now you click airstrike which makes you go inside of a free cam mode while in that mode you and you find somebody that you want to blow them up you can use the crosshair in the middle of the screen you use it to aim at them and click \"launch one\" which only launch one missile and \"launch all\" which launch all of your missiles that you store.","tags":["Fling things and people","Ftap","Ftap missile controller","Missile controller"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6a4f28db9e54371298807d57","username":"Gvghk","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/9db34910c9659023913d8789c7dec0d90cf4ec8c0ff7709e7f70cdc5347c08ee.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6a4f28db9e54371298807d57-1787386852350.png"},"lvl":7,"status":"offline","id":"6a4f28db9e54371298807d57","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":100000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/9db34910c9659023913d8789c7dec0d90cf4ec8c0ff7709e7f70cdc5347c08ee.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6a4f28db9e54371298807d57-1787386852350.png"}},"reviewed":{"name":"QueueSherlock","role":"reviewer","roleLabel":"Paid reviewer","at":"2026-10-20T16:51:23.949Z","profile":"/u/QueueSherlock"},"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":100,"conf":0.1,"n":{"w":1,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":1,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":1,"at":"2026-10-23T23:29:12.513Z","last":"w","win":14,"math":4,"upd":0},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"6ad4240f0ca0a19beaf8369a","editBy":{"_id":"6a4f28db9e54371298807d57","username":"Gvghk","status":"o